{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_title", "source_sha256": "4e07b45a01f9c03b046b145cb21f1930113c6e9141dfcf9fcdcd8021205af7f0", "ja": "解夏傀儡カウントダウン留守電", "zh": "解夏傀儡倒计时留言", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "23bb20ec310a81506465264c867ab7a918491ecf04463503752299ea825e5783", "ja": "現代伝奇ホラーの撮影を控えた\r\n育からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是即将参与现代传奇恐怖片拍摄的育留下的语音留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "03f2e7aae436ef57b1c3c236c5402878619088edf86ffa116b83985bbdacd64c", "ja": "もしもし、{$P$}さん。\nおつかれさまです。……あれ？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了。……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b9e310a89aa1d5070996c8517f325d8d1b19ceab792999bb01613184e779835", "ja": "留守電かな？　そっか……もうすぐ映画の撮影だから、\nきっと、いっぱい準備してくれてるんだよね。", "zh": "是在留言吗？这样啊……马上就要开始电影拍摄了，所以你一定在帮忙做很多准备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "e51a670f2913e44f2e0c0af9a8051fb65cbd030c4129d418b428c2dd14cd0c36", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}さん。わたしも\n素敵な映画にできるように、たくさんがんばるね！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生。我也会努力把电影拍得精彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "c9bd00c672b9d51f3d3c49a374a84f63779281e78f97d0be1cf3d2be249e9ecf", "ja": "あ、そうだ。電話した用事……。えっと、その映画の\n撮影のことについて、なんだけど。", "zh": "啊，对了。打电话是有件事……那个，关于那部电影拍摄的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "bae7816245e43007a06c367a36c99910dc6f00d7043837698a8cd5d4cc14a887", "ja": "とっても山奥にある村に行くんだよね。\nさっき、瑞希さんたちにも聞いたんだけど……。", "zh": "我们要去一个非常偏远的山村，对吧。\n刚才我也问过瑞希姐姐她们了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "b29f5b3b41d633eb6d413b48f6a1c95c92f136dd44cda85b6433ff6ecf71e85d", "ja": "けっこう歩くなら、やっぱりしっかりしてる、\nちゃんとした靴を買ったほうがいいかな？", "zh": "要走不少路的话，果然还是买双结实、像样的鞋比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "8b05904c3ef2031348c20c090f065cbbf15c58796b1bb7404fff104503da747a", "ja": "このみさんと桃子ちゃん、春香さんはいつもの靴にも\nよるけど、用意してもいいかも、って言ってて。", "zh": "木实姐、桃子还有春香姐说，虽然也要看平时穿的鞋子，但准备一双也许比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "52569e9c7a5c6a97bb780c06ac3eb05ca1f34f731f80a191730cde6e5447b3bf", "ja": "貴音さんと瑞希さん、あとまつりさんは、\n運動靴でも大丈夫だと思うって言ってたんだ。", "zh": "贵音小姐、瑞希小姐，还有茉莉小姐都说，\n我觉得穿运动鞋应该也没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "6be4033ddcd8af6c4bae0b0c0562ea302fc2909fb958450b67f623ce408c8974", "ja": "迷っちゃったから、{$P$}さんの\n意見を聞きたかったんだけど……う～ん。", "zh": "因为有点拿不定主意，所以想听听{$P$}先生的\n意见……嗯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "9a417fcf95f5bda06376eb46c4652e9424ab6b6fd2683b58dd2a68be7e2e206d", "ja": "やっぱり、明日相談にのってくれる？\nお仕事終わってからでいいから。お願い！", "zh": "明天果然还是想找你商量一下，可以吗？\n等工作结束之后就行。拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_550_rs_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_550_rs_04_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "0972f57d5e26846a7420acef1d37de1ae8b2be49953387f3e22ccb15e98c3424", "ja": "それじゃあ{$P$}さん、また明日！\nお仕事、がんばってね！", "zh": "那么{$P$}先生，明天见！\n工作加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
